  "coverage": "Current mapped five provinces plus Ashgabat and Arkadag; 51 mapped district/city units, including the capital city boroughs. Arkadag is promoted from its OSM subarea position to its statutory first-level city status and removed from Ahal’s fill. OpenStreetMap relation snapshots retrieved 26 October 2026. Boundaries are an administrative map reference. Shared international edges follow existing atlas neighbours; population is separately dated. Inland lake surfaces are excluded. National GDP is retained separately and never assigned to regions.",
